{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.00](8-8-8-8-808 Mafia)\n[00:04.62](Gezin)\n[00:05.76]Uh, hey\n[00:11.42]I—\n[Chorus]\n[00:11.88]Been through this a thousand times (Uh)\n[00:14.84]Without love, feels like I'll die (Uh)\n[00:17.84]Hopefully I'm satisfied (Uh)\n[00:20.74]Sometimes I just chase my highs\n[00:23.70]Been through this a thousand times\n[00:26.70]Without drugs, feels like I'll die (Uh)\n[00:29.68]Hopefully I'm satisfied (Uh)\n[00:32.78]I tend to just chase my highs (Hey)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:35.78]I know ignorance is bliss, but I don't know what ignorant is\n[00:38.88]Does that make me ignorant? Am I filled with ignorance?\n[00:41.70]I ain't wanna fall in love again, damn near fell in love again\n[00:44.66]They judge me based off my feelings more than the color of my skin\n[00:47.60]It's hard to stay focused with these demons roaming\n[00:50.36]They walkin' through my head looking for a place to live (Woah, woah, woah, woah)\n[00:53.96]It's hard to stay focused with these demons roaming (Woah, woah, woah)\n[00:56.50]They walkin' through my soul lookin' for a new crib\n[01:00.02]You can't tell me that I don't know who Lucifer is\n[01:02.44]I probably know him better than them niggas livin' in hell\n[01:05.56]You don't understand my struggle, think I don't make any sense?\n[01:08.50]If you don't go through what I go through, this is not for you to get\n[Chorus]\n[01:11.48]Been through this a thousand times\n[01:14.10]Without love, feels like I'll die\n[01:17.06]Hopefully I'm satisfied (Uh)\n[01:20.00]Sometimes I just chase my highs\n[01:22.96]Been through this a thousand times\n[01:25.96]Without drugs, feels like I'll die\n[01:28.88]Hopefully I'm satisfied\n[01:32.04]I tend to just chase my highs\n[Verse 2]\n[01:34.08]Walkin' through a hallway of darkness (Yeah)\n[01:36.24]Shadows follow me (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:37.42]God told me to keep walkin' (Uh), close my eyes and look away (Yeah)\n[01:40.18]The devil boolin' on my shoulders (Uh), telling me to numb the pain (Uh)\n[01:43.40]My temptations are a lot, like a bad bitch, ayy-ayy-ayy\n[01:46.72]I been through a lot, it's hard to manage, ayy-ayy-ayy\n[01:49.38]I'm in a position to deal damage, ayy-ayy-ayy\n[01:52.72]I can dish it out and take it, hey\n[01:55.18]Shit's about to get ugly, don't look this way\n[01:58.08]Uh, on the real (Uh), in my chest is where the pain lives (Uh)\n[02:01.54]On the real (Uh), try to numb it with the pain pills (Hey)\n[02:04.58]I don't feel (Uh), but I still feel everything (Yeah)\n[02:07.14]I'm down in the dumps, still livin' like a king\n[Chorus]\n[02:10.40]Been through this a thousand times (Uh)\n[02:13.36]Without love, feels like I'll die (Hey)\n[02:16.40]Hopefully I'm satisfied (Uh)\n[02:19.26]Sometimes I just chase my highs (Hey)\n[Been through this a thousand times]\n[02:25.22]Without drugs, feels like I'll die\n[02:28.14]Hopefully I'm satisfied\n[02:31.30]I tend to just chase my highs (Uh)\n[Outro]\n[02:36.80]Chase my highs, uh, feel the vibes\n[02:41.04]Look me in my eyes, see the hell in my eyes\n[02:46.72]Uh, chase my highs, trying to satisfy\n[03:03.72]Look me in my eyes\n[03:06.12]Real life (Real eyes)\n[03:08.02]Ayy-ayy-ayy","words":[[0.0,0.32,"(8-8-8-8-808"],[1.24,1.98,"Mafia)"],[4.62,5.06,"(Gezin)"],[5.76,5.78,"Uh,"],[5.82,11.38,"hey"],[11.42,11.42,"I—"],[11.88,12.1,"Been"],[12.24,12.44,"through"],[12.62,12.94,"this"],[13.06,13.06,"a"],[13.32,13.94,"thousand"],[14.06,14.52,"times"],[14.68,14.8,"(Uh)"],[14.84,15.54,"Without"],[15.64,15.82,"love,"],[15.9,16.24,"feels"],[16.34,16.66,"like"],[17.4,17.58,"I'll"],[17.62,17.66,"die"],[17.78,17.8,"(Uh)"],[17.84,18.64,"Hopefully"],[18.94,19.06,"I'm"],[19.22,20.44,"satisfied"],[20.48,20.56,"(Uh)"],[20.74,21.48,"Sometimes"],[21.74,21.74,"I"],[21.84,22.12,"just"],[22.2,22.54,"chase"],[22.62,22.84,"my"],[23.02,23.62,"highs"],[23.7,23.92,"Been"],[24.06,24.28,"through"],[24.42,24.78,"this"],[24.9,24.9,"a"],[25.16,25.78,"thousand"],[25.9,26.38,"times"],[26.7,27.3,"Without"],[27.4,27.72,"drugs,"],[27.78,2